---
import Legal from '../layouts/Legal.astro';
import { site } from '../config';
const email = site.supportEmail;
---

<Legal title="Refund Policy" description={`Refunds for ${site.gameName} web shop purchases.`}>
  <p>
    This policy covers purchases made on this website’s shop. Purchases made inside the app are refunded by Google Play
    (or the App Store) under their policies — request those through the store.
  </p>

  <h2>Before you collect your rewards</h2>
  <p>
    Web purchases wait in your in-game inbox until you claim them. If you change your mind within 14 days and haven’t
    claimed the rewards yet, email us with your order ID and we’ll refund you in full.
  </p>

  <h2>After you collect your rewards</h2>
  <p>
    Once rewards are claimed in the game, the digital content has been delivered and used, so we generally can’t refund
    it — except where the law gives you that right, or if something went wrong (for example the rewards never arrived or
    you were charged twice). By buying, you ask us to deliver the content straight away and acknowledge that, where the
    law allows, this ends your right to withdraw once the content has been delivered.
  </p>

  <h2>If something went wrong</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Check your <a href="/account/">account page</a>: a <strong>Paid</strong> order means the rewards are in your in-game inbox.</li>
    <li>If an order is missing or stuck, email <a href={`mailto:${email}`}>{email}</a> with the order ID. We’ll fix it or refund you.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Chargebacks</h2>
  <p>
    Please contact us before disputing a payment with your bank — it’s faster. When a payment is refunded or disputed,
    unclaimed rewards are cancelled; if they were already claimed, we may remove them or review the account.
  </p>

  <h2>How refunds are paid</h2>
  <p>Refunds go back to the original payment method. It can take a few days for your bank to show it.</p>
</Legal>
